      "content": "but why bother with \"lower stakes\"? that's just a slow death. it's just waiting for the inevitable decline to finish the job. if i can't be what i was, then there's no point in being anything at all. facing the end of my career feels like the only way to keep some shred of dignity left. it just feels right to just... end the story before it gets pathetic.",
